{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "561548a5af41d2a56025cba00c0db271f1dc0ad264a7939bd52d19b152c83313", "ja": "（琴葉のライブが、もうすぐ始まる。\n本人はなんだか、緊張した顔をしてるけど……）", "zh": "（琴叶的演唱会就快开始了。\n但她的表情看起来却很紧张……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7613e1bae217618bfe7e5b3b326d3a1c42d5733dbc134799ad9cd37709b04ca6", "ja": "琴葉、お疲れさま。\n緊張してるみたいだけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "琴叶，辛苦你了。\n你看起来好像很紧张，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "ed6a1371bde3090a45afdac5e4e5cf09f3fee77d291c635928a894ecead691a4", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　その……はい。\nちょっとだけ、プレッシャーが……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！我……是的。\n我觉得压力有点大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "c430414f6f186221c87078e321f6d7d8b6f14e21a706a04bfa5cbb18297c6fb9", "ja": "和風のステージと衣装で、いつもと\n雰囲気が違うせいでしょうか……。", "zh": "会不会是因为舞台跟服装的主题都是和风，\n氛围跟平常不太一样的关系呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d81374561b2d99fdfb372adcc1b86793521154c5a50292c386332a268bf20749", "ja": "今日までしっかりレッスンしてきたじゃないか。\nその成果を出せれば、きっと大丈夫だ。", "zh": "在今天之前你不是扎实地训练过了吗？\n只要发挥训练成果，一定没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "8dc3ca60b05d1bc41a238e7b130978a0406b6f9461eed5e52e5e7b195748807e", "ja": "それは……もちろん、そうなんですけど。\nでも、やっぱり色々と考えてしまって……。", "zh": "你说的……当然没错。\n不过我还是想了很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "64f858f594e5c8f5a2b570a942a3bba9700fafb98a6b3d74d3ce9f115bcc8c32", "ja": "和風のステージ、そして着物に見立てた衣装。\nこれは、日本を象徴するようなものですから……。", "zh": "和风舞台、仿和服设计的服装，\n这些都是象征日本的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "9b0e1427902f905bde3c17b2b317036e9311dd5cd07ea5a94db05804ebcf0223", "ja": "それを私が務めることで、果たして、\n日本の歴史や文化を伝えられるのかどうか……。", "zh": "让我承担这个重责大任，\n究竟能否表达出日本的历史及文化呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8ea96cd23328df35676564440d546db237a66a445a49c61b7b97ea27691c38fa", "ja": "そ、そこまで考えてたのか？", "zh": "你、你想得这么深入啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "fac79fed7ed02d53a15427f47cf2e578a7edfab90bbe7f536bb063076f756cd6", "ja": "すみません……アイドルとしては、それだけじゃ\nダメだってこと、わかっているつもりなんですけど。", "zh": "对不起……我很清楚，\n身为偶像，光是这点程度还不够。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "e4fcba6841f71e6efbd57351bbd5f5e4f46cc516c3417de1c8611ee0985d6fa6", "ja": "でも私がしっかりしないと、日本の文化に\n泥を塗ってしまうんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "但又觉得自己要是没振作起来，\n可能会丢了日本文化的脸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1011_p", "source_sha256": "99b54d054c0f39088ac4da6b5f4962bd9ba10d3c53f0da1e0d711d464c0875c4", "ja": "考えすぎだよ、琴葉。それにお客さんが\n期待してるのは、琴葉のステージなんだから。", "zh": "你想太多了，琴叶。\n而且观众期待的，是琴叶你的表演啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "b2ca26b836b0582b9a1a12576ca3803a99be2017fe6f3ed2ce05868220a4dd9e", "ja": "私……ですか？", "zh": "我的……表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f42f1d579eacb0a3994419693657de7f6ab563da13edca1e2af398f0aaf8e55b", "ja": "うん。日本の歴史や文化も大事だけど……\nお客さんが見たいのは、何よりも琴葉だと思う。", "zh": "嗯。虽然日本的历史及文化也很重要……\n但我想，观众的关注焦点还是在琴叶身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5c49e7c679e1be294debc839e3b4a0e23a045188d528089f2453c00a065a4575", "ja": "完成度が高いに越した事はないけど……それより、\n琴葉が今日のために頑張った姿が、見たいのかもな。", "zh": "要是完成度很高当然再好不过……但观众更想看的，\n或许是琴叶为了今天全力以赴的模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "2119eeb3a9ae418a5ed248ebb0fbc9b510d8330ec7c468be8ce1a6cbb31e7679", "ja": "そう……なんですね。たしかに、今日まで\n積み重ねた練習は、誰にも負けないつもりです！", "zh": "说得……也是。的确，\n我在今天之前累积的练习量，绝不会输给任何人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c4ec4602ebd06950413624eae0d574301ea249c23b74140beee1463937ba65dd", "ja": "なら、自分の努力を信じよう。\nそして思いきり、ライブを楽しむ事！", "zh": "既然如此，你就相信自己的努力吧。\n然后尽情享受演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "e2a72b6bd2700837a16bc4e7a7bb5738753b67ff7c40b4e90c4bbf55e81ba333", "ja": "{$P$}……わかりました！\n私、精いっぱいやってみます。", "zh": "{$P$}……我知道了！\n我会尽力去试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "0fa11cfde593d675365c3d8df7f2f85010a52afa0c26864bd39542da5bbaf008", "ja": "そして、お客さん達に笑顔になってもらいます！\nふふっ。", "zh": "然后，我要让观众的脸上都充满笑容！\n呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0144_1019_p", "source_sha256": "06abad3273043222803b6be4139539dd747fdcc04df0558e86b5836eb7717e50", "ja": "（少し肩の力が抜けたのかな……いい笑顔だ。\n頑張れ、琴葉！）", "zh": "（看来她总算稍微放松了……这笑容很棒。\n加油啊，琴叶！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
